@base = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@studentToken = paste-token-locally
@adminToken = paste-token-locally
@repairerToken = paste-token-locally
@orderId = replace-with-new-order-id
@repairerId = replace-with-repairer-id

### Login: replace password locally, never commit real credentials
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"jwt_demo_student","password":"fill-locally-do-not-commit"}

### Me
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Visible orders
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Create new demo order (use returned id)
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"漏水","description":"水龙头漏水","location":"1栋101"}

### Approve
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Assign
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"repairerId":{{repairerId}}}

### Start
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}

### Finish
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"已更换水龙头"}

### Accept
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true}

### Anonymous must return 401
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### Student approving must return 403
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jwt_demo_student",
  "password":"fill-locally-do-not-commit"
}

### 验证当前身份
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 验证未登录
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/me

### 学生审核应返回403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/repair-orders/999999/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
### Flowable Stage A: engine tests only; business API unchanged.
# Run: mvn -B test "-Dflowable.stageA=true"
# No workflow HTTP endpoints until stages B/D.

### Stage B notes: same business API; workflow enabled only in isolated tests.
# Run: mvn -B test "-Dflowable.stageA=true" "-Dflowable.stageB=true"
# Do not enable workflow or run migrations on dorm_repair_db yet.
# Invalid transition/repeated operation: 409; wrong owner or role: 403.
# Defaults keep workflow writes closed: 503 when database connectivity is available.

### Request rework (after finish; use a NEW test order only)
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":false}

### Restart rework with the same repairer; then call finish and accept again
POST {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}

### Stage C verified using real HTTP on 127.0.0.1:18080 (test server stops after suite).
# Run all: mvn -B test "-Dflowable.stageA=true" "-Dflowable.stageB=true" "-Dflowable.stageC=true"
# Test-only profile/key; production remains unmigrated and workflow writes disabled.
# Do not run demo writes against the production database.

### Stage D: activate integration profile on the isolated database first.
# See FRONTEND-API.md. Replace orderId with the NEW order returned by create.

### Detail (owner)
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Repair records (all rework rounds, stable chronological order)
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/records?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Workflow and allowed actions
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders/{{orderId}}/workflow
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Current user's pending tasks
GET {{base}}/api/workflow/tasks?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}

### Repairer selection (admin only)
GET {{base}}/api/users/repairers?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Bounded existing array list
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders?page=0&size=20&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pagination boundary: expect 400
GET {{base}}/api/workflow/tasks?size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Missing or invisible detail: expect 404
GET {{base}}/api/repair-orders/9223372036854775807
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### V2.0-A isolated foundation: no token must return tracked V2 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:18081/api/v2/system/info
X-Request-Id: manual_v20a_review
